    /// <param name="source">**The recording the laboratory is over**, by its token — one of the sources this edition carries (`bentrix://sources`); the first of them when omitted. A source this edition does not carry is refused: its laboratory found on disk replays, and no new one is made.</param>
    /// <param name="timeZone">A time zone's code, as the sheet offers them (UTC by default).</param>
