    /// <summary>
    /// Makes markets that move together in the laboratory of generated markets: a basket of the gallery by its name (USD majors with an exact derived cross, Crypto majors, Two markets), or members of the caller's own (each a recipe's text) with a correlation matrix the fit approximates - made positive semi-definite the nearest way, approximated by a number of factors and pair factors - each member storing its loadings, never the matrix. Answers the markets, the implied matrix, and for a fit the valid matrix, the achieved one and its largest distance from the typed one. With workbench, every market joins it.
