public sealed class StudyApi
{
    private readonly Client _c;

    internal StudyApi(Client c) => _c = c;

    /// <summary>
    /// Attaches an indicator to a chart with its defaults — the person's saved default for the kind when there is one — as the indicator menu does; a custom study (custom:&lt;id&gt;) with its spec's defaults, or the inputs given. on, timeframe and wait_close set what it is computed on, as the settings card's Inputs tab does, for a built-in and a custom study alike; a timeframe the chart cannot read is refused by name. Answers the chart, the new study's id among its studies.
