    /// <param name="times">UTC milliseconds, oldest first, at most 5000: bar opens of what the study is computed on — the chart's interval, or on a chart built by price the candles behind it, or the study's own timeframe when it has one; on a chart's elements each element's candle open (chart_elements_get).</param>
